":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C9A836FD353D89B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1222660007:0":{"text":"ネリアンさん、あなたみたいな人が、どうして決まりを破ってまで船を？","source_cn":"那么，纳莉安小姐，你是个本分的工人，为什么要违背禁令呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x365ACAEF978DE019","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1222660008:0":{"text":"ほ、他に方法がなかったのよ……弟が手紙で、重い病気にかかってしまったから、最後に一目会いたいって……","source_cn":"我……我走投无路了。我收到弟弟的信，他说自己得了重病，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x37D096F34390C145","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1222660009:0":{"text":"でもブラッディ・マリーが封鎖令を敷いて、船の出航を禁じたから、仕方なく……","source_cn":"但是血薇帮下了封锁令，不许船只出港，我没有办法，又很着急……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6D06123612755A7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1222660010:0":{"text":"なるほど。とても仲の良い弟さんなんですね。船を買って、水夫まで雇うとなると、かなりのお金が必要でしょう。","source_cn":"这样啊，纳莉安小姐和弟弟的感情一定很深，毕竟一整艘船和...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DEC5DB14B73C2C6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1222660011:0":{"text":"ふん、あのギャンブル……あっ、そ、そうよ、とても大事な弟なの。あの子のためなら、いくらお金がかかってもかまわないわ。","source_cn":"哼，那个赌鬼……不，我